{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version of the full game. In this reduced version of the full game, you will have access to 10+ units and 6 different levels. Over 300+ enemy formations and 3 unique boss fights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUY UNITS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase units to add them to your army. Spend your coin wisely to maximize your effectiveness in battle. Three options of purchasable units are available to you and are randomized every time you roll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.poster.avif?t=1756417674\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.webm?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.mp4?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UPGRADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgraded versions of your units, and if you get lucky, purchase upgrades for you to utilize throughout your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.poster.avif?t=1756417674\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.webm?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.mp4?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WAGE WAR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter a battle, arrange your troops in a way that gives you the highest chance of winning. Each unit has its strengths and weaknesses, so think strategically; you only have three lives per run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.poster.avif?t=1756417674\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.webm?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/6310c86dc75c8e490f39f9c01c5e0295.mp4?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974000?t=1756417674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3974000?t=1756417674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/be1fd09231d1853df7cd8b981383388fc24a1468/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756417674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/be1fd09231d1853df7cd8b981383388fc24a1468/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756417674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are scenes of cartoonish violence / cartoonish blood"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a demo version of the full game. In this reduced version of the full game, you will have access to 10+ units and 6 different levels. Over 300+ enemy formations and 3 unique boss fights!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUY UNITS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase units to add them to your army. Spend your coin wisely to maximize your effectiveness in battle. Three options of purchasable units are available to you and are randomized every time you roll.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.poster.avif?t=1756417674\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.webm?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/f22c17fa71ae8f264fe1d23b2f57ca84.mp4?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>UPGRADES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgraded versions of your units, and if you get lucky, purchase upgrades for you to utilize throughout your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.poster.avif?t=1756417674\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.webm?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3974000/extras/18bcbcae38dfd7d6d3f919664494a45b.mp4?t=1756417674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>WAGE WAR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you enter a